 <title>Integración de Drupal con Alfresco ECM a través de CMIS (Content Management Interoperability Services)</title>
 <link>http://2010.drupalcamp.es/sessions/integracion-de-drupal-con-alfresco-ecm-traves-de-cmis-content-management-interoperability-s</link>
 <description>&lt;fieldset class=&quot;fieldgroup group-session-logistics&quot;&gt;&lt;legend&gt;Logística&lt;/legend&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field field-type-text field-field-session-day&quot;&gt;
